  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Web Belts offer unmatched durability and customizability, making them perfect for a wide range of uses. Measuring up to 64 inches long, these uniform belts can be easily cut to achieve the perfect fit. The high-density cotton canvas material ensures long-lasting wear, while the secure metal buckle keeps the duty belt firmly in place. The detachable buckle allows for further customization in both length and style, accommodating your personal preferences.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
